## 3. Create the Leaflet map **first**

```js
// Basic Leaflet map (the “container” for everything)
const leafletMap = L.map('map', {
  center: [40.7128, -74.0060], // New York City
  zoom: 12,
  // Important: disable Leaflet's default tile layer – we’ll add the GL layer next
  // (you can keep it if you want a raster fallback)
});
```

You can add any Leaflet layers you already use (markers, GeoJSON overlays, etc.) **before** or **after** the GL layer – they will be composited in the order you add them.

